<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-29T21:54:51.288Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:54:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Afghan Taliban mortar fire on the northwest Pakistan border killed one civilian and wounded five, while separate Afghan firing near Angoor Adda injured five people. Pakistan responded by striking Taliban positions, destroying border check posts, and launching an operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar. The Pakistani minister linked the border closure to rising LPG prices, and arrest warrants were issued in the Radio Pakistan attack case. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/qatar-urges-iran-to-show-goodwill-by-ending-threats-to-the-region-and-reopening-the-strait&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5JNFNLTGlTSnNCSVk3ZEcyQWlXYVFYZHVzSDFUdURxdmdHVjZyWUdmRlpmd1pfbG84UDNmSnRzaUlEWWNUckpKbA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQMl9GeFk5TXhOMVRqRlE0VWEtU29aT3ZEbTVxbm43Y1NDb21abDAwTmI1Tjk2Mmo4eVdVZTZmSnhXZkc4U1pxeUoyMHFteHMwWTJLT3ZTeFJfMmt6QW51dk5pblZuaFdfdmdzTmxmLXh6MUQ4aUJIZDNweUlvZ1U3dDBGWngtRVRCYkR2UFJ4Wkxac2U1T1ZNTHRkVWNTa2o4N0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5pcEIxa2VweDl4MTU3ajN4UEQwa3dNRXBJWHc0cmxYX3FHRFViYVJibF84eldZWExCc1dUNU5qU1JsUF9XbF9rcA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPSXVmSm1fdHZ2ckh0NGRRV1lIU0F2VnhlbkNrbWFSZGQ0ak8yRTJ0RTJtZzNsak15Q2hFZ3pmaUN3Sl9LUXVjODBPTDlWY1NwZzBpNlpjM0wtWHJUcXZfV0Y4dTh0bDRqUUc0SHVJdGtJbUpuR3VpUW1mcUdmbV93WTBlQmh4RVAwMzVQelhnUEpFNVdlOHYtWXRXSUEzbDVzLUhoUl9vWjlFNUpIbVBQeA?oc=5&quot;&gt;WFTU&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBM